{#
  Escape hatch for sections that are too bespoke for a generic block — forms,
  share widgets, anything with its own JavaScript or load-bearing element ids.

  The section still sits in the page's block list, so it can be reordered and
  hidden from the Content Manager like any other; only its internals are fixed
  in code. Its content lives in components/custom/<include>.njk.

  `include` is checked against this whitelist rather than interpolated straight
  into an include path, so a typo renders nothing instead of breaking the build.
  Add new partials here and to the "Which section" options in src/admin/config.yml.
#}
{% set CUSTOM_INCLUDES = ["get-involved-newsletter", "get-involved-share"] %}
{%- if block.include in CUSTOM_INCLUDES -%}
{% include "components/custom/" ~ block.include ~ ".njk" %}
{%- endif -%}
